  "heading": "Escape from custody.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 51,
  "text": "Any person subject to this Act who, being in lawful custody, escapes or attempts to escape, shall, on conviction by court-martial, be liable to suffer imprisonment for a term which may extend to five years or such less punishment as is in this Act mentioned.",
